# LICENSE — HealthAI Atlas (dual licence)

This repository is dual licensed. The two full licence texts ship as separate machine-readable files:

- Code: `LICENSE-CODE` — GNU AFFERO GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE v3.0 (SPDX: `AGPL-3.0-only`)
- Data: `LICENSE-DATA` — Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (SPDX: `CC-BY-NC-4.0`)

Which licence applies to what:

- `AGPL-3.0-only` covers the source code: `frontend/` (excluding `frontend/src/data/`), `backend/`, `ansible/`, `scripts/`, `.github/`, `design-system/`, and all build/CI configuration.
- `CC-BY-NC-4.0` covers the datasets and editorial content under `frontend/src/data/` (plus the matching methodology/editorial docs): free to copy, redistribute and adapt for non-commercial purposes with attribution; commercial use requires a separate paid licence.
- Records in `frontend/src/data/` carry their own source URLs. Those third-party sources stay attributable in their own right — nothing here removes that attribution, and every record must keep pointing at the source it came from.

Attribution for data/content: "Data from HealthAI Atlas (https://healthaiatlas.com), CC BY-NC 4.0."

Contributions follow the same split: code under AGPL-3.0, data/content under CC BY-NC 4.0 — see `CONTRIBUTING.md`.

For commercial use of either code or data, contact the project owner (see the public site's About page, or `SECURITY.md`).

Decision recorded 2026-04-29.
